{"id":"48c93bb273602891","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-reflexive-order-tree.md","title":"Trees ordered by predecessors","display":"df-reflexive-order-tree — Trees ordered by predecessors","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-reflexive-order-tree","aliases":["72-df-reflexive-order-tree"],"display":"df-reflexive-order-tree — Trees ordered by predecessors","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files","source_kind":"local-reconstruction","verification_status":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-reflexive-order-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-reflexive-order-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-reflexive-order-tree — Trees ordered by predecessors"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local reconstruction of the interface required by the supplied book-72 files"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-reconstruction"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D\\times D\">\\(R\\subseteq D\\times D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uRv\">\\(uRv\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 是从前驱到后继的反身关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 允许为空。</li>\n<li>本文件的树仅要求每个节点的前驱段为良序，不要求整棵树存在根，也不要求向后继方向不存在无限分支。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PO}\">\\(\\operatorname{PO}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq D\\times D\\land\\forall u\\in D\\ uRu\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in D\\ ((uRv\\land vRu)\\to u=v)\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in D\\ ((uRv\\land vRw)\\to uRw),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)&amp;:=\\{u\\in D:uRv\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}(D,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PO}(D,R)\\land\\forall v\\in D\\ [\\forall u,w\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)\\ (uRw\\lor wRu)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)\\ (A\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists a\\in A\\ \\forall b\\in A\\ aRb)].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq D\\times D\\land\\forall u\\in D\\ uRu\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in D\\ ((uRv\\land vRu)\\to u=v)\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in D\\ ((uRv\\land vRw)\\to uRw),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)&amp;:=\\{u\\in D:uRv\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}(D,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PO}(D,R)\\land\\forall v\\in D\\ [\\forall u,w\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)\\ (uRw\\lor wRu)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)\\ (A\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists a\\in A\\ \\forall b\\in A\\ aRb)].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按现有Tree(D,R)反身偏序调用重建，不引入错误的Tree58占位符。地址前缀树给出实例；带规则标签的证明树及其额外良基要求继续由72自己的证明树文件定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D\\times D","display":false},{"tex":"uRv","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PO}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tree}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{PO}(D,R)&:\\Longleftrightarrow R\\subseteq D\\times D\\land\\forall u\\in D\\ uRu\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall u,v\\in D\\ ((uRv\\land vRu)\\to u=v)\\land\\forall u,v,w\\in D\\ ((uRv\\land vRw)\\to uRw),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)&:=\\{u\\in D:uRv\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Tree}(D,R)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PO}(D,R)\\land\\forall v\\in D\\ [\\forall u,w\\in\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)\\ (uRw\\lor wRu)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\operatorname{Pred}_R(v)\\ (A\\ne\\varnothing\\to\\exists a\\in A\\ \\forall b\\in A\\ aRb)].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1763,"backlinks":[{"id":"a1053151913b8ba4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D$ 是集合，$R\\subseteq D^2$。$\\operatorname{Tree}(D,R)$ 为 [[72-df-reflexive-order-tree]] 的实际二元接口，其R是反身偏序。"}],"outgoing":[]}